+Important schema details:
+
+- `memories` has `repo_id`, not `scope`.
+- Global memories are `repo_id IS NULL`.
+- Workspace memories use `repo_id = ?`.
+- Resolve DB path with `path.resolve(process.cwd(), env.SESSION_DB_PATH)`.
